  "verseCount": 8,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Seven Angels With Seven Plagues",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I saw in heaven another great and marvelous sign: seven angels with the seven last plagues—last, because with them God's wrath is completed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw what looked like a sea of glass glowing with fire and, standing beside the sea, those who had been victorious over the beast and its image and over the number of its name. They held harps given them by God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and sang the song of God's servant Moses and of the Lamb:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 15:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Great and marvelous are your deeds,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 15:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lord God Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 15:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Just and true are your ways,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 15:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "King of the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who will not fear you, Lord,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 15:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and bring glory to your name?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 15:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "For you alone are holy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 15:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "All nations will come",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 15:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and worship before you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 15:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for your righteous acts have been revealed.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this I looked, and I saw in heaven the temple—that is, the tabernacle of the covenant law—and it was opened.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Out of the temple came the seven angels with the seven plagues. They were dressed in clean, shining linen and wore golden sashes around their chests.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then one of the four living creatures gave to the seven angels seven golden bowls filled with the wrath of God, who lives for ever and ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the temple was filled with smoke from the glory of God and from his power, and no one could enter the temple until the seven plagues of the seven angels were completed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
